  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi></math> is a complex number such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>,</mi></math> then the minimum value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "ulhPr",
      "text": "Is strictly greater than <math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>5</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EyEDi",
      "text": "Is strictly greater than <math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math> but less than <math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>5</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "tUiM6",
      "text": "Is equal to <math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>5</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "N1bvd",
      "text": "Lies in the interval <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>.,&#160;&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>&#8756;</mo> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;The distance of &#39;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi></math>&#39; from origin is greater than two.<br />We have to find minimum of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo></math> distance of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi></math> from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.<br /><br />On the argand plane,<br /><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/af97b440-4a2c-401c-89e2-9cad247aa5a0-image.png\" style=\"width: 378px; height: 229px;\" /><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi></math> lies in the dotted regions <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>II</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>III</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>IV</mi><mo>.</mo></math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>&#8756;</mo> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The minimum distance is from the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math><math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
    "image": null
